{
 "_report": "Glacia, rebuilt on the V3 world kit (Map Logic Pack). Arrive at the Glacia Spaceport (east) and walk west through Frostmark Lane Homes into Frostmark (kept V2 town core with its glass-dome houses and Ice Lodge; bottom edge opened at x=10-13 row 15 where the path already runs off the map; Recovery Bay and shop swapped to the kit rooms under their old ids 094/095; M12/S80 givers stay). Frost Crossroads south of town is the hub: east to the Quiet Court (Research Lab, Fossil Vault, houses) and down to Crevasse Hollows (dead end, chest); south via Aurora Overlook (S80 lookouts) and Floe Shore (frozen lake, water edge) to the Farmstead, the Glacier Rink Arena (exterior -> lobby -> battle room) and, west of the arena, the Helix front (Frozen Research Annex -> Helix Secret Lab); west along the kept Aurora Route Part A (096, Kit's Iceburr scene) to Floe Fork (frozen lake). Floe Fork: west to the Aurora Relay Tower (Trial Floor 103 -> Keeper Room 104 with Ingrid); north to Ice Junction -> Crystal Caverns (entrance + B1/B2/Depths reusing old ids 098-100 so S81/M12 spots and trainers stay; chest in the Depths) and the Hidden Ice Grove (chest); south down Frostfall Slope to Frozen Falls (S82, frozen_falls table) and the Fossil Dig Flats (dead end; M12 fossil sites and the four fossil signs moved here from the old Fossil Dig).",
